      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "398. 在三面角中两个面角等于 $60^\\circ$，另一个等于 $90^\\circ$. 求",
        "相对于直角的面角的棱对于这个角所在的平面的倾斜角."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "399",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$399^{*}$. 求与三面角所有的棱的距离相等的全部点的",
        "集合."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "400",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$400^{*}$. 设任一三面角的面角为 $\\alpha$、$\\beta$、$\\gamma$，证明下列不等式",
        "成立：",
        "$\\cos\\alpha+\\cos\\beta+\\cos\\gamma>-\\frac{3}{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "401",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$401^{*}$. 证明：三面角两个面角的平分线和第三个面角的",
        "邻补角的平分线在同一个平面内."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "402",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "402. 多面角的面角能取下列数据吗？1) $80^\\circ$、$130^\\circ$、",
        "$70^\\circ$、$100^\\circ$；2) $10^\\circ$、$20^\\circ$、$40^\\circ$、$80^\\circ$、$160^\\circ$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "403",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "403. 在四面角 $SABCD$ 中，所有的面角及角 $ASC$ 都等",
        "于 $60^\\circ$. 求它的二面角的度数."
      ]
    },
